    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates through climate model simulations that including ocean-atmosphere interactions significantly amplifies and extends the global climate impacts of irrigation, approximately doubling the magnitude of surface temperature changes and increasing the fraction of the globe experiencing significant climate effects compared to simulations with fixed oceans.",
